msgid "Time-dependent density functional theory"
msgstr "含时密度泛函理论"

msgid ""
"Excitation energies and linear response properties can be calculated "
"utilising the time-dependent density functional theory (TDDFT) method. The "
"program should normally be called after a Kohn-Sham or Hartree-Fock "
"calculation because it looks for the most recent orbital dump record to read"
" in the MO coefficients and orbital energies. Further settings like the "
"functional type and quadrature grid are then adopted from the previous "
"ground-state calculation, yet some may also be modified via input commands "
"in the TDDFT program. Detailed descriptions for the different calculation "
"modes are given in the following subsections."
msgstr ""
"激发能和线性响应性质可以利用含时密度泛函理论（TDDFT）方法进行计算。该程序通常应在 Kohn-Sham 或 Hartree-Fock "
"计算之后调用，因为它会查找最近的轨道转储记录以读入分子轨道系数和轨道能量。随后，诸如泛函类型和求积网格等进一步设置将从先前的基态计算中继承，但其中一些也可以通过"
" TDDFT 程序中的输入命令进行修改。不同计算模式的详细描述在以下小节中给出。"

msgid "TDDFT program"
msgstr "TDDFT 程序"

msgid ""
"Assuming that the molecule has :math:`C_{2v}` symmetry, a typical input for "
"calculating the 6 lowest roots of the Hessian for IRREp 1 and 3, "
"respectively, reads"
msgstr ""
"假设分子具有 :math:`C_{2v}` 对称性，一个典型的用于分别计算 IRREp 1 和 3 的 Hessian 矩阵 6 个最低根的输入如下"

msgid ""
"The type of the xc kernel is usually adjusted automatically using the "
"parameters from the previous ground-state KS calculation. However, various "
"user inputs are available to change this, see below. Currently,  density "
"functionals of the (hybrid) LDA or GGA type as well as range-separated "
"LDA/GGA functionals are supported in TDDFT. Note, however, that currently "
"unsupported meta GGA’s (or special xc potentials for which the kernel can "
"not (easily) be derived) may be combined with existing adiabatic LDA (ALDA) "
"xc kernels."
msgstr ""
"xc 核的类型通常使用先前基态 KS 计算的参数自动调整。然而，有多种用户输入可用于更改此设置，详见下文。目前，TDDFT 支持（杂化）LDA 或 "
"GGA 类型的密度泛函以及范围分离的 LDA/GGA 泛函。但请注意，目前不支持的 meta GGA（或那些无法（轻易）推导出其核的特殊 xc "
"势）可以与现有的绝热 LDA（ALDA）xc 核结合使用。"

msgid ""
"Excitation energies for spin-unrestricted wave functions can be computed, "
"too, using, e.g."
msgstr "自旋非限制波函数的激发能也可以计算，例如使用"

msgid "for time-dependent Hartree-Fock (TDHF) or"
msgstr "用于含时 Hartree-Fock（TDHF）或"

msgid "for time-dependent DFT."
msgstr "用于含时 DFT。"

msgid "The program can be run in various integral transformation modes using"
msgstr "该程序可以使用不同的积分变换模式运行，通过"

msgid ""
"with ``ityp=[ao|mo|mo(df)|df]``. With ``ityp=ao`` (set as the default) an "
"MO-AO transformation of the excitation vectors is performed. This requires "
"the 4-indexed Coulomb repulsion integrals in the AO basis to be stored on "
"disk. ``ityp=mo`` means that a full 4-index MO transformation to the Coulomb"
" and exchange operators (2-external MO integrals) is performed. These are "
"then used to build the Hessian-vector products in each TDDFT Davidson "
"iteration step. While this option is faster than ``ityp=ao`` it requires a "
"larger amount of disk space available."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``ityp=[ao|mo|mo(df)|df]``\\ 。当 ``ityp=ao``\\ （设为默认值）时，会对激发向量执行 MO-AO "
"变换。这需要将原子轨道基组中的 4 指标库仑排斥积分存储在磁盘上。\\ ``ityp=mo`` 意味着对库仑和交换算符（2-外部 MO 积分）执行完整的"
" 4 指标 MO 变换。这些变换后的积分随后用于在每个 TDDFT 戴维森迭代步骤中构建 Hessian 矩阵-向量乘积。虽然此选项比 "
"``ityp=ao`` 更快，但它需要更大的可用磁盘空间。"

msgid ""
"While both, ``ityp=ao`` and ``ityp=mo`` require the storage of the 4-indexed"
" AO integrals on disk, it is also possible to avoid this using density-"
"fitting"
msgstr ""
"虽然 ``ityp=ao`` 和 ``ityp=mo`` 都需要在磁盘上存储 4 指标原子轨道积分，但也可以通过使用密度拟合来避免这种情况，"

msgid ""
"in which case only 3-indexed integrals are used to compute the Hessian-"
"vector products. While this requires an additional auxiliary basis set to be"
" defined, the program can usually detect the fitting basis set that "
"corresponds to the given orbital basis automatically, so that normally no "
"additional information needs to be passed to the program. If a special "
"fitting basis set shall be used one can add"
msgstr ""
"在这种情况下，仅使用 3 指标积分来计算 Hessian 矩阵-"
"向量乘积。虽然这需要定义一个额外的辅助基组，但程序通常可以自动检测与给定轨道基组对应的拟合基组，因此通常无需向程序传递额外信息。如果要使用特殊的拟合基组，可以添加"

msgid ""
"with ``auxbas`` corresponding to a basis set keyword that was defined in the"
" ``basis`` section."
msgstr "其中 ``auxbas`` 对应于在 ``basis`` 部分定义的基组关键字。"

msgid ""
"Note that density-fitting can also be used in conjunction with "
"``inttype=mo`` in which case the Coulomb and exchange integrals are computed"
" using density-fitting, thus avoiding the storage of the 4-indexed AO "
"integrals."
msgstr ""
"请注意，密度拟合也可以与 ``inttype=mo`` 结合使用，在这种情况下，库仑和交换积分使用密度拟合计算，从而避免存储 4 指标原子轨道积分。"

msgid ""
"The following list summarises the keywords available in the TDDFT program:"
msgstr "以下列表总结了 TDDFT 程序中可用的关键字："

msgid ""
"``STATES`` A list which supplies the number of excitations to be calculated "
"per IRREp: [N\\ :math:`_1`.IRREP\\ :math:`_1`,N\\ :math:`_2`.IRREP\\ "
":math:`_2`,\\ :math:`\\dots`]"
msgstr ""
"``STATES`` 一个列表，提供每个不可约表示要计算的激发态数量：[N\\ :math:`_1`.IRREP\\ :math:`_1`,N\\ "
":math:`_2`.IRREP\\ :math:`_2`,\\ :math:`\\dots`]"

msgid "``BASIS`` Sets the auxiliary basis set if ``MODE``\\ =1,\\ ``DFIT=.true.``"
msgstr "``BASIS`` 当 ``MODE``\\ =1,\\ ``DFIT=.true.`` 时，设置辅助基组。"

msgid ""
"``FXKS`` Factor that determines the amount of the ALDA exchange (Slater-"
"Dirac) kernel (if ``XCMODE``\\ :math:`\\le 10`)."
msgstr ""
"``FXKS`` 决定 ALDA 交换 (Slater-Dirac) 核贡献量的因子 (如果 ``XCMODE``\\ :math:`\\le "
"10`)。"

msgid ""
"``FCKS`` Factor that determines the amount of the ALDA correlation (VWN5) "
"kernel (if ``XCMODE``\\ :math:`\\le 10`)."
msgstr "``FCKS`` 决定 ALDA 相关 (VWN5) 核贡献量的因子 (如果 ``XCMODE``\\ :math:`\\le 10`)。"

msgid ""
"``FXHF`` Factor that determines the amount of exact Hartree-Fock exchange."
msgstr "``FXHF`` 决定精确 Hartree-Fock 交换贡献量的因子。"

msgid ""
"``XCKERNEL`` XC kernel type which can take the settings: "
"``XCKERNEL=[lda|gga|lda(df)|gga(df)]``. Concerning ``lda(df)|gga(df)``, see "
"``FITFXC`` option below."
msgstr ""
"``XCKERNEL`` XC 核类型，可设置为：\\ ``XCKERNEL=[lda|gga|lda(df)|gga(df)]``\\ 。关于 "
"``lda(df)|gga(df)``\\ ，请参阅下面的 ``FITFXC`` 选项。"

msgid ""
"``XCMODE`` Sets the type of exchange-correlation kernel routines to be used "
"in the Hessian-vector transformations. ``XCMODE``\\ =1-10 "
":math:`\\rightarrow` reserved for ALDA kernels, ``XCMODE``\\ =11-20 "
":math:`\\rightarrow` reserved for GGA kernels. (normally not required)"
msgstr ""
"``XCMODE`` 设置在 Hessian 矩阵-向量变换中使用的交换-相关核程序类型。\\ ``XCMODE``\\ =1-10 "
":math:`\\rightarrow` 保留给 ALDA 核，\\ ``XCMODE``\\ =11-20 :math:`\\rightarrow` "
"保留给 GGA 核。(通常不需要)"

msgid ""
"``TRIPLET`` Set to :math:`\\ne 0` if triplet excitations instead of singlet "
"excitations shall be computed."
msgstr "``TRIPLET`` 如果要计算三重态激发而非单重态激发，则设置为 :math:`\\ne 0`\\ 。"

msgid "``CORE`` Set the number of core orbitals."
msgstr "``CORE`` 设置芯轨道的数量。"

msgid "``TOLORB`` Threshold for orbital screening (default: :math:`1e-5`)."
msgstr "``TOLORB`` 轨道筛选的阈值（默认值：\\ :math:`1e-5`\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``NBLOCK`` Block size of numerical quadrature batches used in xc kernel "
"integrations."
msgstr "``NBLOCK`` 用于 xc 核积分中数值求积分批处理的块大小。"

msgid ""
"``THRRHODUM`` Skip quadrature points around dummy centres if the density is "
"lower than the given threshold when ``FITFXC``\\ :math:`>0` is used. "
"(default: ``THRRHODUM``\\ =0d0)"
msgstr ""
"``THRRHODUM`` 当使用 ``FITFXC``\\ :math:`>0` 时，若密度低于给定阈值，则跳过虚拟中心周围的积分点。（默认：\\ "
"``THRRHODUM``\\ =0d0）"

msgid ""
"``FIT1MOD`` Switch between dfit (0) and ri technique (1) for ``FITFXC``\\ "
":math:`=1` case. (default: ``FIT1MOD``\\ =\\ :math:`1`)."
msgstr ""
"``FIT1MOD`` 在 ``FITFXC``\\ :math:`=1` 情况下，在 dfit (0) 和 ri 技术 (1) 之间切换。（默认：\\"
" ``FIT1MOD``\\ =\\ :math:`1`\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``COULGRID`` If :math:`>0` compute the Coulomb kernel contribution via "
"numerical quadrature rather than calculating the Coulomb integrals "
"explicitly. Note: this option is not available with all settings and is "
"normally only used in conjunction with range-separated density functionals "
"in which case the full-range Coulomb integrals are not available on disk "
"(``INTTYPE``\\ =\\ :math:`0,1` case). (default: ``COULGRID``\\ =\\ "
":math:`0`)"
msgstr ""
"``COULGRID`` 如果 :math:`>0`\\ "
"，则通过数值求积计算库仑核贡献，而不是显式计算库仑积分。注意：此选项并非在所有设置下都可用，通常仅与范围分离密度泛函结合使用，因为在这种情况下，全范围库仑积分无法在磁盘上获得（\\"
" ``INTTYPE``\\ =\\ :math:`0,1` 的情况）。(默认值：\\ ``COULGRID``\\ =\\ :math:`0`)"

msgid ""
"``TRIPLET`` Compute triplet excitation energies instead of singlet "
"excitations (note: singlet and triplet excitations are obtained both "
"simultaneously in case of unrestricted calculations, so the option only "
"makes sense for the closed-shell case) (default: ``TRIPLET``\\ =\\ "
":math:`0`)."
msgstr ""
"``TRIPLET`` "
"计算三重态激发能而非单重态激发能（注意：在非限制性计算中，单重态和三重态激发能是同时获得的，因此该选项仅对闭壳层情况有意义）(默认值：\\ "
"``TRIPLET``\\ =\\ :math:`0`)。"

msgid ""
"``FXCOP`` Calculate the 4-indexed Fxc operator integrals if "
"``inttype=mo(df)`` (default: ``FXCOP``\\ =\\ :math:`0`)"
msgstr ""
"``FXCOP`` 如果 ``inttype=mo(df)``\\ ，则计算 4 索引 Fxc 算符积分 (默认值：\\ ``FXCOP``\\ =\\"
" :math:`0`)"

msgid ""
"``FULLDIAG`` Perform a full diagonalisation of the Hessian if "
"``inttype=mo(df)`` (default: ``FULLDIAG``\\ =\\ :math:`0`)"
msgstr ""
"``FULLDIAG`` 如果 ``inttype=mo(df)``\\ ，则执行 Hessian 矩阵的完全对角化 (默认值：\\ "
"``FULLDIAG``\\ =\\ :math:`0`)"

msgid ""
"``PRINTSTEP`` If symmetry is used, print a summary table including the "
"excitation energies for each IRREp. (default: ``PRINTSTEP``\\ =0)"
msgstr ""
"``PRINTSTEP`` 如果使用了对称性，则打印一个汇总表，包含每个不可约表示 (IRREp) 的激发能。(默认值：\\ "
"``PRINTSTEP``\\ =0)"

msgid ""
"``NCOEFFPRI`` Number of excitation vector coefficients to be printed in the "
"summary table (default: ``NCOEFFPRI``\\ =\\ :math:`4`)"
msgstr "``NCOEFFPRI`` 要在汇总表中打印的激发向量系数的数量 (默认值：\\ ``NCOEFFPRI``\\ =\\ :math:`4`)"

msgid ""
"Parameters which influence the behaviour of the Davidson solvers that can be"
" used (should normally only be modified if convergence is hampered for some "
"reason):"
msgstr "影响可用的 Davidson 求解器行为的参数（通常仅在收敛因某些原因受阻时才应修改）："

msgid "``MAXITDAV:MAXIT`` Maximum number of iterations (default: :math:`50`)."
msgstr "``MAXITDAV:MAXIT`` 最大迭代次数（默认值：\\ :math:`50`\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``DAVMOD`` Davidson solver mode that can have values 1-5. Default: "
"``DAVMOD``\\ =5 (recommended)."
msgstr "``DAVMOD`` Davidson 求解器模式，可取值 1-5。默认值：\\ ``DAVMOD``\\ =5（推荐）。"

msgid ""
"``MAXVEC`` Maximum number of expansion vectors in the eigensolver procedure."
msgstr "``MAXVEC`` 本征求解过程中展开向量的最大数量。"

msgid "``THRE`` Energy threshold value. Default: ``THRE``\\ =1d-6."
msgstr "``THRE`` 能量阈值。默认值：\\ ``THRE``\\ =1d-6。"

msgid ""
"``THRS`` Threshold for smallest eigenvalue of S (``DAVMOD``\\ =5, default: "
"``THRS``\\ =1d-6)."
msgstr "``THRS`` S 的最小特征值阈值（\\ ``DAVMOD``\\ =5，默认值：\\ ``THRS``\\ =1d-6）。"

msgid ""
"``THRS_UPDATE`` Threshold for smallest eigenvalue of S of update vectors "
"(``DAVMOD``\\ =5, default: ``THRS``\\ =1d-4)."
msgstr "``THRS_UPDATE`` 更新向量的 S 最小特征值阈值（\\ ``DAVMOD``\\ =5，默认值：\\ ``THRS``\\ =1d-4）。"

msgid ""
"``THRD`` Threshold for norm of expansion vectors (``DAVMOD``\\ =5, default: "
"``THRS``\\ =-1d0)."
msgstr "``THRD`` 展开向量范数阈值（\\ ``DAVMOD``\\ =5，默认值：\\ ``THRS``\\ =-1d0）。"

msgid ""
"``THRQ`` If the norm of a new computed expansion vector is smaller than this"
" value, it will be discarded in the iterative update of the vector space "
"(for ``DAVMOD``\\ =1,2). Default: ``THRR``\\ =1d-2."
msgstr ""
"``THRQ`` 如果新计算的展开向量的范数小于此值，则在向量空间的迭代更新中将其丢弃（适用于 ``DAVMOD``\\ =1,2）。默认值：\\ "
"``THRR``\\ =1d-2。"

msgid ""
"``USYM`` If ``DAVMOD``\\ =1,2 either compute a symmetrised subspace Hessian "
"(``USYM``\\ =0) or not (``USYM``\\ =1). Default: ``USYM``\\ =0."
msgstr ""
"``USYM`` 如果 ``DAVMOD``\\ =1,2，则计算对称化的子空间 Hessian 矩阵（\\ ``USYM``\\ =0）或不计算（\\"
" ``USYM``\\ =1）。默认值：\\ ``USYM``\\ =0。"

msgid ""
"``DEFL`` Perform deflation step in the Davidson solver (``DAVMOD``\\ =1,2). "
"Default: ``DEFL``\\ =1."
msgstr "``DEFL`` 在 Davidson 求解器中执行收缩步骤（\\ ``DAVMOD``\\ =1,2）。默认值：\\ ``DEFL``\\ =1。"

msgid "``SHIFT`` Denominator shift (``DAVMOD``\\ =5, default: ``SHIFT``\\ =0d0)."
msgstr "``SHIFT`` 分母位移（\\ ``DAVMOD``\\ =5，默认值：\\ ``SHIFT``\\ =0d0）。"

msgid ""
"``PROJECT`` If true, project new vectors against old ones ``DAVMOD``\\ =5, "
"default: ``PROJECT``\\ =1)."
msgstr "``PROJECT`` 如果为真，将新向量投影到旧向量上（\\ ``DAVMOD``\\ =5，默认值：\\ ``PROJECT``\\ =1）。"

msgid ""
"``CHECK`` If :math:`>0` print energy checks at the end (``DAVMOD``\\ =5, "
"default: ``CHECK``\\ =0)."
msgstr ""
"``CHECK`` 如果 :math:`>0`\\ ，则在最后打印能量检查（\\ ``DAVMOD``\\ =5，默认值：\\ ``CHECK``\\ "
"=0）。"

msgid ""
"``REPLACE_DIAG`` If true, use exact hessian diag for lowest vectors "
"(``DAVMOD``\\ =5, default: ``REPLACE_DIAG``\\ =0)."
msgstr ""
"``REPLACE_DIAG`` 若为真，对最低向量使用精确的 Hessian 矩阵对角线（\\ ``DAVMOD``\\ =5，默认：\\ "
"``REPLACE_DIAG``\\ =0）。"

msgid ""
"A number of options from the list above can be given separately in the TDDFT"
" command group, e.g.:"
msgstr "上述列表中的多个选项可以在 TDDFT 命令组中单独指定，例如："

msgid "Some of them are exclusive, namely:"
msgstr "其中一些选项是互斥的，即："

msgid ""
"``STABIL`` Perform a stability analysis of the SCF wave function (computes "
"the lowest eigenvalue of the electronic Hessian :math:`{\\bf A}+{\\bf B}`)."
msgstr ""
"``STABIL`` 对 SCF 波函数进行稳定性分析（计算电子 Hessian 矩阵 :math:`{\\bf A}+{\\bf B}` "
"的最低特征值）。"

msgid ""
"``SAVE`` Save the excitation vectors to a record for, e.g., restarting "
"another TDDFT calculation from these"
msgstr "``SAVE`` 将激发向量保存到记录中，以便，例如，从这些向量重新启动另一个 TDDFT 计算"

msgid ""
"``READ`` Read excitation vectors from a record and use these as the initial "
"start vectors (it goes without saying that the dimensions etc. should match "
"exactly those of the current calculation)"
msgstr "``READ`` 从记录中读取激发向量，并将这些用作初始启动向量（不言而喻，维度等应与当前计算完全匹配）"

msgid ""
"``NVIR`` Truncate the number of virtual orbitals (only possible with "
"``inttype=mo(df)``)"
msgstr "``NVIR`` 截断虚轨道的数量（仅在 ``inttype=mo(df)`` 时可用）"

msgid ""
"``NCOREX`` Specify the number of core orbitals set exclusively for the "
"exchange contribution to the Hessian, ie., this setting enables to use "
"different sizes for the core for the Coulomb and the exchange contributions."
msgstr "``NCOREX`` 指定专用于 Hessian 矩阵交换贡献部分的芯轨道数量，即，此设置允许对库仑贡献和交换贡献使用不同大小的芯轨道。"

msgid ""
"Default values for all parameters may also be looked up in the "
"``tddft.registry`` file."
msgstr "所有参数的默认值也可以在 ``tddft.registry`` 文件中查找。"

msgid "Analysing the spectrum"
msgstr "分析光谱"

msgid ""
"The excitation vectors can be exported to formats for visualisation by using"
" either"
msgstr "激发矢量可以通过使用以下任一方式导出为可视化格式："

msgid ""
"which exports the excitation densities to a file which can be read with the "
"program `Molden <https://www3.cmbi.umcn.nl/molden>`__ (vectors are stored as"
" MO coefficients, so can be visualised using the orbital selection interface"
" of Molden) or, alternatively, via"
msgstr ""
"该选项将激发密度导出到一个文件中，该文件可以用程序 `Molden <https://www3.cmbi.umcn.nl/molden>`__ "
"读取（矢量存储为分子轨道系数，因此可以使用 Molden 的轨道选择界面进行可视化），或者，也可以通过"

msgid ""
"in which case for each excitation a Gaussian cube file is created which can "
"be visualised with various external programs, e.g.,  `JMol "
"<http://jmol.sourceforge.net>`__. Note that these two options currently are "
"implemented only for closed-shell restricted calculations."
msgstr ""
"在这种情况下，每个激发态都会生成一个高斯立方文件，可以使用各种外部程序进行可视化，例如 `JMol "
"<http://jmol.sourceforge.net>`__\\ 。请注意，这两个选项目前仅针对闭壳层限制性计算实现。"

msgid ""
"The linear response to (frequency-dependent) perturbations can be calculated"
" with the TDDFT program using (use ``states=[]`` explicitly in order to skip"
" the calculation of excitation energies):"
msgstr "(频率相关)微扰的线性响应可以使用TDDFT程序计算（显式使用 ``states=[]`` 以跳过激发能的计算）："

msgid ""
"For the calculation of multipole-multipole polarisabilities it is possible "
"to use the short-hand input variant"
msgstr "对于多极-多极极化率的计算，可以使用简写输入变体"

msgid ""
"in which case all :math:`l=1,2,3` rank responses (dipole, quadrupole and "
"octopole) are computed without having to insert all individual cartesian "
"components. If all components for a given rank are given, the program "
"performs a transformation to the corresponding spherical harmonics "
"representation and prints the results in the output as well."
msgstr ""
"在这种情况下，所有 :math:`l=1,2,3` "
"阶响应（偶极、四极和八极）都会被计算，而无需插入所有单独的笛卡尔分量。如果给定了某个阶的所有分量，程序会执行到相应球谐函数表示的转换，并将结果也打印在输出中。"

msgid "Dispersion coefficients"
msgstr "色散系数"

msgid "Dispersion coefficients can be calculated using"
msgstr "色散系数可以使用以下方式计算"

msgid ""
"where ``nfreq`` denotes the number of quadrature points for the numerical "
"calculation of the integral over imaginary frequencies with the Casimir-"
"Polder integral transform. Normally, values of the order of ``nfreq``\\ =\\ "
":math:`10` are sufficient for accurate integrations. The Gauss-Legendre "
"quadrature scheme as described in the paper by `Amos et al. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1021/j100257a010>`__ is used in the response program."
msgstr ""
"其中 ``nfreq`` 表示使用Casimir-Polder积分变换对虚频率积分进行数值计算的积分点数量。通常，数量级为 ``nfreq``\\ "
"=\\ :math:`10` 的值足以进行精确积分。响应程序中使用了 `Amos等人 "
"<https://doi.org/10.1021/j100257a010>`__ 论文中描述的高斯-勒让德求积方案。"

msgid ""
"with :math:`\\alpha^A` and :math:`\\alpha^B` denoting the isotropic dipole-"
"dipole polarisabilities of the two monomers. The :math:`C_6` coefficients "
"are computed automatically if ``prop,q1`` is used. Higher order coefficients"
" :math:`C_8` and :math:`C_{10}` can be computed as well if quadrupole-"
"quadrupole and dipole-octopole polarisabilities are available "
"(``prop,q1,q2`` or ``prop,q1,q2,q3``). Note that the :math:`C_{10}` "
"coefficients are computed even if no octopole moments are given in the input"
" file. The values then contain only the quadrupole-quadrupole "
":math:`\\times` quadrupole-quadrupole polarisability contributions."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`\\alpha^A` 和 :math:`\\alpha^B` 表示两个单体的各向同性偶极-偶极化率。如果使用 "
"``prop,q1``\\ ，\\ :math:`C_6` 系数会自动计算。如果四极-四极和偶极-八极极化率可用（\\ ``prop,q1,q2`` 或"
" ``prop,q1,q2,q3``\\ ），也可以计算更高阶的系数 :math:`C_8` 和 :math:`C_{10}`\\ "
"。请注意，即使输入文件中没有给出八极矩，也会计算 :math:`C_{10}` 系数。此时的值仅包含四极-四极 :math:`\\times` 四极-"
"四极化率的贡献。"

msgid "The following options can be set in the TDDFT response program:"
msgstr "可以在 TDDFT 响应程序中设置以下选项："

msgid ""
"``LESOLVE`` In case of unsymmetric Hessians (hybrid or range-separated "
"functionals) one can choose between two different linear solvers (default: "
"``LESOLVE``\\ =\\ :math:`1`). Otherwise, a standard conjugate gradient "
"solver is used to solve the response equations."
msgstr ""
"``LESOLVE`` 对于非对称 Hessian 矩阵（杂化或范围分离泛函），可以在两种不同的线性求解器之间选择（默认：\\ "
"``LESOLVE``\\ =\\ :math:`1`\\ ）。否则，使用标准共轭梯度求解器来求解响应方程。"

msgid ""
"``THRCG`` Convergence threshold value for the (conjugate gradient) solver "
"(default: ``THRCG``\\ =\\ :math:`1d-8`)"
msgstr "``THRCG`` （共轭梯度）求解器的收敛阈值（默认：\\ ``THRCG``\\ =\\ :math:`1d-8`\\ ）"

msgid "Rotatory strengths"
msgstr "旋光强度"

msgid ""
"Rotatory strengths for the excitations requested can be calculated with"
msgstr "所请求激发的旋光强度可通过以下方式计算"

msgid ""
"Rotatory strenghths can be currently computed only for the spin-restricted "
"TDDFT case."
msgstr "旋光强度目前仅能针对自旋限制的TDDFT情况进行计算。"

msgid ""
"Currently this is possible for closed-shell singlet excited states using "
"LDA, GGA, hybrid-GGA or range-separated hybrid functionals."
msgstr "目前，这仅适用于使用LDA、GGA、杂化GGA或范围分离杂化泛函的闭壳层单重激发态。"

msgid ""
"In TDDFT gradient calculations it is recommended to set tighter thresholds "
"for the convergence of the excited state vectors and for the iterative "
"solution of the Z-vector equation. E.g., for small systems the following "
"settings would be reasonable:"
msgstr "在TDDFT梯度计算中，建议为激发态矢量的收敛和Z向量方程的迭代求解设置更严格的阈值。例如，对于小体系，以下设置是合理的："

msgid ""
"Note that by default the gradient is computed for the lowest excitation of a"
" given symmetry (calculations for multiple symmetries are not allowed for "
"gradient calculations). This can be changed by setting the parameter "
"``gradvec``, e.g."
msgstr ""
"请注意，默认情况下，梯度是针对给定对称性的最低激发态计算的（梯度计算不允许进行多个对称性的计算）。这可以通过设置参数 ``gradvec`` "
"来改变，例如，"

msgid ""
"will compute the gradient for the 4th excited state of the second symmetry. "
"It is necessary, of course, that the number of states requested by the "
"``states`` command  is equal to or larger than ``gradvec``. Note that an "
"eigenvector-following method like is implemented in the EOM-CCSD program is "
"not yet available for TDDFT geometry optimisations. Because of this it might"
" happen that the initial starting guess is not followed strictly when there "
"are crossings with other close excitations on the PES. This will be improved"
" in a future version of the program."
msgstr ""
"将计算第二个对称性的第4个激发态的梯度。当然，\\ ``states`` 命令请求的状态数必须等于或大于 ``gradvec``\\ "
"。请注意，类似于EOM-"
"CCSD程序中实现的特征向量跟踪方法目前尚不适用于TDDFT几何优化。因此，当势能面上存在与其他邻近激发态交叉时，初始起始猜测可能不会被严格遵循。这将在程序的未来版本中得到改进。"

msgid ""
"There are a few special parameters which can influence the behaviour of "
"tddft gradient calculations. Most of them are for debugging purpose and "
"should normally not changed compared to their default values set in the "
"registry file."
msgstr "有几个特殊参数可以影响tddft梯度计算的行为。其中大多数用于调试目的，通常不应更改其注册文件中设置的默认值。"

msgid ""
"``GRADEXC`` If set to ``GRADEXC``\\ =0 the ground-state DFT gradient "
"contribution for the xc energy are computed with the standard DFT routines. "
"When set to ``GRADEXC``\\ =1 both the xc energy and kernel gradient "
"contributions are computed simultaneously in a separate routine."
msgstr ""
"``GRADEXC`` 如果设置为 ``GRADEXC``\\ =0，则使用标准DFT例程计算xc能量的基态DFT梯度贡献。当设置为 "
"``GRADEXC``\\ =1 时，xc能量和核梯度贡献将在一个单独的例程中同时计算。"

msgid ""
"``GRADPRI`` Print the gradient at various stages in the program if set >0."
msgstr "``GRADPRI`` 如果设置 >0，则在程序的不同阶段打印梯度。"

msgid ""
"``DENSVD`` Use singular value decomposed density matrices in some AO based "
"xc routines."
msgstr "``DENSVD`` 在一些基于AO的xc例程中使用奇异值分解的密度矩阵。"

msgid ""
"``DFGRADMODE`` Switch between different df-gradient modes for the "
"calculation of the 2el-contribution to the tddft gradient."
msgstr "``DFGRADMODE`` 在计算tddft梯度的2el贡献时，在不同的df梯度模式之间切换。"

msgid ""
"``MAXAUX`` Maximum number of auxiliary functions for transformed integral "
"blocks in the density-fitting Fock routine."
msgstr "``MAXAUX`` 密度拟合Fock程序中变换积分块的最大辅助函数数量。"

msgid "``MAXBAT`` Maximum number of loop batches in df gradient routines."
msgstr "``MAXBAT`` df梯度程序中循环批次的最大数量。"

msgid ""
"``DISK`` Use disk (=1) or a global array (=0) to store half-transformed "
"integrals in the density-fitting Fock routine. This setting will only be "
"used during the calculation of the gradient terms."
msgstr "``DISK`` 使用磁盘(=1)或全局数组(=0)来存储密度拟合Fock程序中的半变换积分。此设置仅在计算梯度项时使用。"
